{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_095_align-title\">ALIGN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">ALIGN 的主要贡献不是新交互模块，而是简单 EfficientNet/BERT 双塔在十亿级未精洗图文对上的规模化训练。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Demonstrates that a simple EfficientNet + BERT dual encoder trained on over one billion noisy web image–alt-text pairs learns robust cross-modal representations.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">网页图像与未经精细清洗的 alt-text 对</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Web image + minimally filtered raw alt-text description</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">共享空间中的图像和文本 embedding，用于检索与零样本分类</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Shared-space image and text embeddings for cross-modal retrieval and zero-shot classification</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v139/jia21b.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_095_align')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_095_align')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"ALIGN original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/3b7218148b4756ec4c44.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_095_align\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_095_align')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_095_align\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">网页图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">弱监督图像侧输入</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests web image + minimally filtered raw alt-text description and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"弱监督图像侧输入\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests web image + minimally filtered raw alt-text description and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"网页图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">网页图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">弱监督图像侧输入</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests web image + minimally filtered raw alt-text description and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"大规模但存在错配、缺漏与模板噪声\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes noise alt-text to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"噪声 alt-text\" data-node-name-en=\"noise alt-text\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声 alt-text</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise alt-text</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">大规模但存在错配、缺漏与模板噪声</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes noise alt-text to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"独立图像 encoder 生成全局视觉特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs EfficientNet-L2 within the core billion scale noisy dual encoder clip computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"EfficientNet-L2\" data-node-name-en=\"EfficientNet-L2\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>EfficientNet-L2</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">独立图像 encoder 生成全局视觉特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs EfficientNet-L2 within the core billion scale noisy dual encoder clip computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"独立文本 encoder 生成句级特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs BERT-Large within the core billion scale noisy dual encoder clip computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"BERT-Large\" data-node-name-en=\"BERT-Large\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>BERT-Large</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">独立文本 encoder 生成句级特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs BERT-Large within the core billion scale noisy dual encoder clip computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"两模态映射到同维单位球\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection normalization within the core billion scale noisy dual encoder clip computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"投影与归一化\" data-node-name-en=\"projection normalization\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">投影与归一化</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection normalization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">两模态映射到同维单位球</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection normalization within the core billion scale noisy dual encoder clip computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"所有图像与所有文本做点积并除以温度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs matrix within the core billion scale noisy dual encoder clip computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"批内相似度矩阵\" data-node-name-en=\"matrix\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">批内相似度矩阵</span><span class=\"lang-en\">matrix</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">所有图像与所有文本做点积并除以温度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs matrix within the core billion scale noisy dual encoder clip computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"image-to-text 与 text-to-image 两方向识别配对项\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 07 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"双向对比交叉熵\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">双向对比交叉熵</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">image-to-text 与 text-to-image 两方向识别配对项</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 07 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"文本提示可充当分类原型\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces shared-space image and text embeddings for cross-modal retrieval and zero-shot classification via zero-shot.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"零样本/检索表示\" data-node-name-en=\"zero-shot\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_095_align', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">零样本/检索表示</span><span class=\"lang-en\">zero-shot</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">文本提示可充当分类原型</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces shared-space image and text embeddings for cross-modal retrieval and zero-shot classification via zero-shot.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"ALIGN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 海量噪声图文对的双向对比对齐</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Billion-Scale Noisy Image–Alt-Text Bidirectional Contrastive Learning</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"ALIGN：核心公式 · 海量噪声图文对的双向对比对齐\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"95\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"29.776259pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -68.617578 262.057631 29.776259\" width=\"262.057631pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><use id=\"m095_g29-22\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m095_g26-22\"></use><use id=\"m095_g29-49\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m095_g26-49\"></use><use id=\"m095_g29-50\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m095_g26-50\"></use><use id=\"m095_g29-103\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m095_g26-103\"></use><use id=\"m095_g29-108\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m095_g26-108\"></use><use id=\"m095_g29-111\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m095_g26-111\"></use><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m095_g10-0\"></path><path d=\"M4.709614-3.579306V-3.985058H.449225V-3.579306H2.376544V0H2.782295V-3.579306H4.709614Z\